From: Evolve Expansion <expansion@example.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:55:49 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Warriors of the Organization: recruitable elite warriors

- Randomly generated recruits: five stats, perks/flaws, temperament,
  potential grade, rank; renameable
- Hiring fee and daily wages; loyalty, desertion and grudges
- Fire Emblem-style level ups with per-stat growth rates
- Personal Awakening meter; rest with cooldown; Awakened warriors
  become named bosses
- Battle deaths with 5-25% chance to defy death; Hall of the Fallen
- Hooks into combat rating, hunts, raids, campaigns and stress

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016HmsZNbhLtGaJpfe2FaNeB
